# Version sync

When changing the `version` field in `package.json`, also update the hero badge on the docs site:

- **File:** `docs/index.html`
- **Element:** `<span class="version-tag">v…</span>` in the hero CTA row
- **Format:** prefix with `v` (e.g. package `0.4.2` → page `v0.4.2`)

Do not leave a version bump in `package.json` without updating this badge in the same change.
